Fork point
----------
Lx-ui was forked from 3x-ui at upstream commit
a8d0700b ("fix(auth): add node-admin token scope for panel updates (#6666)"),
which is 3x-ui v3.10.2 plus two follow-up commits. The complete upstream git
history is preserved in this repository.

Modification statement (GPL-3.0 section 5a)
-------------------------------------------
Lx-ui modifies the upstream work. The modifications, and the dates they were
made, are recorded in:
  * the git history of this repository (every change is a separate commit),
  * docs/LX_CHANGES.md (human-readable summary of how Lx-ui differs),
  * docs/UPSTREAM_SYNC.md (which upstream commits and pull requests were taken).

"3x-ui" and "3X-UI" are the names of the upstream project and are used here
only to describe the origin of this software. Lx-ui is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the 3x-ui project.

