----------------------
Lx-ui embeds or downloads third-party software that keeps its own license,
including (non-exhaustive):
  * Xray-core (https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core)            - MPL-2.0
  * amneziawg-go (https://github.com/amnezia-vpn/amneziawg-go) - MIT
  * mtg-multi (https://github.com/mhsanaei/mtg-multi)          - see upstream
